sequenceDiagram
    participant S as School Portal
    participant J as Download Service
    participant D as Archive Store
    S->>J: POST result-downloads
    J-->>S: 202 Accepted + job_id
    J->>D: Read school's results (async)
    D-->>J: Rows
    J->>J: Generate timestamped file
    S->>J: GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}
    J-->>S: 200 ready + file reference
